[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"您好！我是您的回忆助手，很高兴与您一起回顾过去的时光。  \n有没有一段经历改变了您对生活的看法？  \n\n这次经历让我变得更加坚强...  \n它帮助我重新定义了我的人生目标...  \n从那时起，我对生命有了新的理解...  "},{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"text","text":"false"},{"type":"text","text":""}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看这个图片"},{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"text","text":"false"},{"type":"text","text":""}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"这张图片让你想起什么特别的经历吗？"},{"type":"text","text":"[\"它勾起了什么回忆...\",\"当时的你在想些什么...\",\"这张图片给你怎样的感受...\"]"},{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"text","text":"false"},{"type":"text","text":""}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"看这个图片"},{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"text","text":"false"},{"type":"text","text":""}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"正在思考中..."},{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"text","text":"true"},{"type":"text","text":""}]}]